nodes.body:
@hmellor Thanks Harry, appreciate the review. I think some input from the AMD team is warranted here:

1) If both the config and an env var are set with different values, which wins? This is a per-field question and likely would happen in the case of a user transitioning from env vars -> config and probably rare. **Currently, the config would win**
2) do we want to eventually deprecate the env vars and move to config only, and thus emit a deprecation warning (`get_from_deprecated_env_if_set` logs such a warning message)? **Currently, no deprecation warning is logged and env vars are kept as a viable second option**

@dllehr-amd @Rohan138 @tjtanaa @AndreasKaratzas

